gb41(){return"Lads, we're at home today. These stands are ours, this grass is ours."},
gb42(){return"We're in front of our own fans. They're waiting for us, and we owe them."},
gb43(){return"This is our ground, boys. Nobody comes here and plays at ease."},
gb3T(){return"We're away, lads. The stands are theirs, but it's eleven against eleven out there."},
gb3U(){return"Nobody here is going to help us. Whatever we take, we take ourselves."},
gb3V(){return"We've come a long way, boys. We didn't come to go home empty-handed."},
gb3W(){return"Everyone sees us as favourites. We'll prove it on the pitch, not on paper."},
gb3X(){return"We're expected to win this one. Doing what's expected is a craft too."},
gb4a(){return"We're up against a strong side today. Nobody gives us a chance. Good, let them think that."},
gb4b(){return"A tough evening awaits us. But big teams lose too, lads."},
gb48(){return"We won't talk about the last game. That chapter is closed; today we turn a new page."},
gb49(){return"We all felt the last one. Today we answer on the pitch."},
gb46(){return"We're on a good run, boys. But yesterday's game doesn't score today."},
gb47(){return"We built this run. Same hunger, same focus, we keep going."},
gb3R(){return"First game of the season, lads. Tonight we set the tone for the whole year."},
gb3S(){return"New season, new story. Tonight we write the first line."},
gb44(){return"This is a cup tie, lads. Every ball, every duel here means going through."},
gb45(){return"There's no second chance in the cup, boys. Whoever wants it more goes through."},
gb3Y(){return"It's the final, lads. We worked all season for tonight."},
gb3Z(){return"Everyone in this room earned tonight. Now we go and take that trophy."},
gb4_(){return"It's a friendly, but we stay serious. What you show here is what you'll play in the league."},
gb40(){return"Today it's more about our game than the result. I want to see what we've practised."},
gb4p(){return"We're going forward today. Pin them back in their own half."},
gb4q(){return"The moment we win the ball, we face their goal. No back passes, look forward."},
gb4r(){return"Don't be afraid to shoot. You'll miss some, but the shot you don't take never goes in."},
gb4s(){return"Use the wings, fill the box. Tonight, goals are our job."},
gb4t(){return"Patience. We shut the door; one chance is enough."},
gb4u(){return"First we lock the back. No gaps between us, nobody gets cut off."},
gb4v(){return"No rush. Let them have the ball, we hold our shape. When the moment comes, we strike."},
gb4w(){return"Today our goal is a fortress. Every ball, we defend first and think later."},
gb4h(){return"Let's play our own game, no rush."},
gb4i(){return"We won't charge blindly and we won't sit back. We play what we know."},
gb4j(){return"Keep the ball calmly, wait for the right moment. We run the game, not the other way round."},
gb4k(){return"We stay close in every area. When one steps out, another covers behind."},
gb4d(){return"We're on them from the first minute. Don't let them breathe."},
gb4e(){return"Every second they have the ball, we go at them. Force the mistakes."},
gb4f(){return"We press high, lads. Don't give them anyone to pass to."},
gb4g(){return"We won't fear getting tired today. For ninety minutes, they get no rest."},
gb4l(){return"This is your game. I believe in you."},
gb4m(){return"Everyone wearing that shirt proves something tonight. I know what you can do."},
gb4n(){return"Every one of you got here through hard work. Now it's time to pour it onto the pitch."},
gb4o(){return"Look at each other. You run for the man next to you, and he runs for you."},
gb4D(){return"Come on, lads, we go out looking for goals!"},
gb4E(){return"Forward! Tonight we're the ones attacking that goal!"},
gb4F(){return"Calm, disciplined, together. Let's go."},
gb4G(){return"Nobody leaves their post. Come on, out we go."},
gb4z(){return"Play smart, don't leave each other. Off we go."},
gb4A(){return"Let's trust ourselves. Come on, out we go."},
gb4x(){return"Come on! At them from the first whistle!"},
